---
const { active = false } = Astro.props;
const HeadingTag = active ? 'h1' : 'p';
---
<section class:list={["feature-workflow-panel","workspace-page"].concat(active ? ['is-active'] : [])} data-feature-panel="OrganizeProject" hidden={!active}>
<section class="workspace-hero feature-shell" aria-labelledby="workspace-title">
    <div class="workspace-hero-copy">
      <HeadingTag data-feature-heading class="feature-kicker" id="workspace-title">One project workspace for every promo order</HeadingTag>
      <h2 class="hero-title display-title">One project. <span>Every detail stays connected.</span></h2>
      <p class="feature-lede">Every project lives in one place. Store products, artwork, customer information, approvals, notes, production files, and project history together.</p>
      <div class="feature-actions"><a class="button button-dark" href="/contact">Talk to Sales <span>↗</span></a></div>
    </div>
    <figure class="workspace-hero-photo">
      <img src="/assets/features/workspace/workspace-hero-team.png" alt="A promotional products team coordinating one connected project around a shared table">
      <div class="workspace-photo-index" aria-hidden="true">
        <span style="--x:8%;--y:12%">Product</span>
        <span style="--x:35%;--y:80%">Artwork</span>
        <span style="--x:66%;--y:9%">Customer</span>
        <span style="--x:78%;--y:73%">Approval</span>
      </div>
      <figcaption><span>Custom Merchandise Campaign</span><strong>Everything the team needs, in one project record.</strong></figcaption>
    </figure>
  </section>

  <section class="workspace-problem feature-shell">
    <p class="feature-kicker">Stop searching for context</p>
    <div class="workspace-problem-grid">
      <h2>The project should not disappear across inboxes and shared folders.</h2>
      <div><p>No more searching through emails or shared folders. PromoPlus keeps the project record intact from the first product choice to the final production file.</p><strong>One place to understand what happened—and what happens next.</strong></div>
    </div>
    <div class="scatter-to-record">
      <div class="scatter-items" aria-label="Disconnected project information">
        <span>Email comment</span><span>Product link</span><span>Artwork final</span><span>Customer note</span><span>Approval PDF</span>
      </div>
      <i aria-hidden="true">→</i>
      <article><small>Connected project</small><b>Custom Hoodie Campaign</b><span>Complete record · current status</span></article>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="record-explorer" id="record-explorer">
    <div class="feature-shell">
      <div class="record-explorer-heading">
        <p class="feature-kicker">Inside one project</p>
        <h2>Seven layers. One source of truth.</h2>
        <p>Select a project layer to see how it stays connected to the same record.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="record-explorer-grid">
        <div class="record-tabs" role="tablist" aria-label="Project record layers">
          <button class="is-active" type="button" role="tab" aria-selected="true" data-record="products"><span>01</span>Products</button>
          <button type="button" role="tab" aria-selected="false" data-record="artwork"><span>02</span>Artwork</button>
          <button type="button" role="tab" aria-selected="false" data-record="customer"><span>03</span>Customer information</button>
          <button type="button" role="tab" aria-selected="false" data-record="approvals"><span>04</span>Approvals</button>
          <button type="button" role="tab" aria-selected="false" data-record="notes"><span>05</span>Notes</button>
          <button type="button" role="tab" aria-selected="false" data-record="production"><span>06</span>Production files</button>
          <button type="button" role="tab" aria-selected="false" data-record="history"><span>07</span>Project history</button>
        </div>
        <div class="record-object" aria-hidden="true">
          <span class="record-sheet sheet-a"></span><span class="record-sheet sheet-b"></span>
          <article><small>Connected record</small><b>Custom Hoodie Campaign</b><div><span>Current layer</span><strong>Products</strong></div><i>Live</i></article>
        </div>
        <div class="record-detail" role="tabpanel" aria-live="polite">
          <small>Products</small>
          <h3>The selected product stays attached to the project.</h3>
          <p>Supplier details, product imagery, sides, and color choices remain available to everyone working on the campaign.</p>
          <div><span>Connected to</span><strong>Artwork · Mockups · Production</strong></div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="project-history feature-shell">
    <div class="project-history-copy">
      <p class="feature-kicker">Complete project history</p>
      <h2>See the whole story, not just the latest file.</h2>
      <p>Products, source artwork, comments, decisions, and production output remain part of the same chronological record.</p>
    </div>
    <figure class="project-history-photo">
      <img src="/assets/features/workspace/workspace-project-history.png" alt="An organized project archive showing product information, artwork versions, notes, approval, and production output">
      <figcaption><span>Project archive</span><strong>Every handoff leaves useful context behind.</strong></figcaption>
    </figure>
    <ol class="history-line" aria-label="Project history sequence">
      <li><span>Product added</span><small>09:12</small></li>
      <li><span>Artwork uploaded</span><small>10:04</small></li>
      <li><span>Version reviewed</span><small>14:18</small></li>
      <li><span>Customer approved</span><small>17:37</small></li>
      <li><span>Production file</span><small>17:39</small></li>
    </ol>
  </section>

  <section class="related-features feature-shell">
    <div class="feature-section-heading"><p class="feature-kicker">Connected operations</p><h2>Organize the record, then help the team move it.</h2></div>
    <div class="related-grid pp-related-pair">
      <a class="workspace-related-link" href="/features/team-collaboration"><small>Next step</small><h3>Team Collaboration</h3><p>Give every role the same project context without another internal handoff.</p><span>Explore feature ↗</span></a>
      <a class="workspace-related-link" href="/features/workflow-progress-dashboard"><small>Connected visibility</small><h3>Workflow Progress Dashboard</h3><p>Track every connected project from creation to production.</p><span>Explore feature ↗</span></a>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="feature-cta feature-shell" id="workspace-contact">
    <div class="pp-cta-copy"><p class="feature-kicker">Bring the project together</p><h2>Ready to replace scattered files with one connected workspace?</h2></div>
    <a class="press-button" href="/contact">Talk to Sales <i>↗</i></a>
  </section>
</section>
